              <h2 class="bd-section__title">GTB India</h2>
            </div>
            <p>The inception of the GTB brand in 1990 marked a significant milestone following the visionary foundation stone laying ceremony by <strong>Mr. Harmeet Singh</strong> for Shiva Fasteners Pvt. Ltd. in 1989. This foundational event set the stage for the emergence of a brand committed to excellence and quality in the manufacturing of zipper fastening products.</p>

            <p>The manufacturing journey commenced in August 1989 with a modest setup in Meerut, India, featuring only a handful of machines. Initially, the focus was on supplying products to the sports and garments industry within Meerut and its neighboring cities. The initial product range centered around polyester coil-forming zippers, commonly known as CFC zippers. Even in these early stages, the commitment to quality was evident, laying the groundwork for the brand's future success.</p>

            <p>As demand for GTB products steadily increased, the manufacturing capabilities expanded in response. This growth led to the establishment of additional manufacturing units in 2001 and 2007, further solidifying the brand's presence in the industry. The incremental expansion reflected the brand's adaptability to market demands and its dedication to meeting the evolving needs of its customers.</p>
